blue_award_extractions = ()
for d in context:
    res = llm_query("You are given one document. Extract relevant information if present. Focus only on content in this single document.\n\nDocument:\nBEGIN_DOCUMENT\n" + d + "\nEND_DOCUMENT\n\nTasks:\n1) Blue Plaque award: If the document mentions a building/site receiving a \"Blue Plaque\" (or similar phrasing like blue plaque/Blue Plaque status) between 2016 and 2019 inclusive, extract:\n- Year of the plaque\n- Building/site name and location\n- Whether at the time of award it was over 140 years old (quote or paraphrase)\n- The institution associated with the site (e.g., school/college/organization)\n- Any ceremony quote indicating it was \"originally the site of a forward-thinking institution that continues to encourage growth and development\" (quote exact phrasing if present).\n\n2) Staff member award: If the document mentions a staff member of the same institution receiving an award after working there for over 20 years, and stating their work was \"challenging and never boring\" (or very similar wording), extract:\n- Staff member's name\n- Award name and year\n- The exact quote containing \"challenging and never boring\" (or similar wording)\n- Who first launched this award (person and organization), if stated.\n\nOutput:\nProvide a compact block starting with 'DOC RESULT:' then bullet points summarizing any findings. Include exact quotes and proper names. If nothing relevant, output 'DOC RESULT: none'.")
    blue_award_extractions = blue_award_extractions + (res,)

final_res = llm_query("You are given extracted notes from multiple documents. Identify the correct institution/award pair matching the query and provide only the surname of the person who first launched the relevant award.\n\nNotes:\n" + "\n\n".join(blue_award_extractions) + "\n\nTask:\nFind the case where:\n- A heritage site received a Blue Plaque between 2016 and 2019, and at that time the building was over 140 years old.\n- At the ceremonious award, it was said the site was originally the site of a forward-thinking institution that continues to encourage growth and development.\n- During the same time period, another staff member of this institution won an award after working there over 20 years, stating their work was \"challenging and never boring.\"\n\nFrom the notes, determine the award that the staff member won and who first launched that award. Provide only the surname of that person. If multiple candidates appear, choose the one that satisfies all constraints above. Output only the surname, with no extra words or punctuation.")
return_result(final_res.strip())